style='mso-ignore:vglayout' clear=ALL>
<span style='font-family:"Calibri",sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:"Times New Roman"'>Project
Structure<o:p></o:p></span></h2>

<p><span style='font-family:"Calibri",sans-serif;color:#333333'>The application
is built leveraging a lightweight Node.js Express backend acting as a
middleware proxy, and a vanilla HTML/CSS/JS frontend utilizing modern web
capabilities like CSS Grid, CSS Variables, and responsive SVG topology scaling.<o:p></o:p></span></p>

<table class=MsoNormalTable border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0 width="100%"
 style='width:100.0%;border-collapse:collapse;mso-yfti-tbllook:1184'>
 <tr style='mso-yfti-irow:0;mso-yfti-firstrow:yes'>
  <td style='border:solid #BDC3C7 1.0pt;mso-border-alt:solid #BDC3C7 .75pt;
  background:#ECF0F1;padding:3.0pt 6.0pt 3.0pt 6.0pt'>
  <p class=MsoNormal style='margin-top:7.5pt;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:
  15.0pt;margin-left:0cm'><b><span style='font-size:10.5pt;font-family:"Calibri",sans-serif;
  mso-fareast-font-family:"Times New Roman";color:#333333'>File<o:p></o:p></span></b></p>
  </td>
  <td style='border:solid #BDC3C7 1.0pt;border-left:none;mso-border-left-alt:
  solid #BDC3C7 .75pt;mso-border-alt:solid #BDC3C7 .75pt;background:#ECF0F1;
  padding:3.0pt 6.0pt 3.0pt 6.0pt'>
  <p class=MsoNormal style='margin-top:7.5pt;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:
  15.0pt;margin-left:0cm'><b><span style='font-size:10.5pt;font-family:"Calibri",sans-serif;
  mso-fareast-font-family:"Times New Roman";color:#333333'>Description<o:p></o:p></span></b></p>
  </td>
 </tr>
 <tr style='mso-yfti-irow:1'>
  <td style='border:solid #BDC3C7 1.0pt;border-top:none;mso-border-top-alt:
  solid #BDC3C7 .75pt;mso-border-alt:solid #BDC3C7 .75pt;padding:3.0pt 6.0pt 3.0pt 6.0pt'>
  <p class=MsoNormal style='margin-top:7.5pt;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:
  15.0pt;margin-left:0cm'><b><span style='font-size:10.5pt;font-family:"Calibri",sans-serif;
  mso-fareast-font-family:"Times New Roman";color:#333333'>server.js</span></b><span
  style='font-size:10.5pt;font-family:"Calibri",sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:
  "Times New Roman";color:#333333'><o:p></o:p></span></p>
  </td>
  <td style='border-top:none;border-left:none;border-bottom:solid #BDC3C7 1.0pt;
  border-right:solid #BDC3C7 1.0pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid #BDC3C7 .75pt;
  mso-border-left-alt:solid #BDC3C7 .75pt;mso-border-alt:solid #BDC3C7 .75pt;
  padding:3.0pt 6.0pt 3.0pt 6.0pt'>
  <p class=MsoNormal style='margin-top:7.5pt;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:
  15.0pt;margin-left:0cm'><span style='font-size:10.5pt;font-family:"Calibri",sans-serif;
  mso-fareast-font-family:"Times New Roman";color:#333333'>Node.js Express
  server. Polls the SNMP agent, parses variables using node-<span class=SpellE>snmpjs</span>,
  and serves JSON payloads via a REST endpoint.<o:p></o:p></span></p>
  </td>
 </tr>
 <tr style='mso-yfti-irow:2'>
  <td style='border:solid #BDC3C7 1.0pt;border-top:none;mso-border-top-alt:
  solid #BDC3C7 .75pt;mso-border-alt:solid #BDC3C7 .75pt;padding:3.0pt 6.0pt 3.0pt 6.0pt'>
