<h2><span style='font-family:"Calibri",sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:"Times New Roman"'>4.
Custom UI Frontend Algorithms<o:p></o:p></span></h2>

<h3><span style='font-family:"Calibri",sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:"Times New Roman"'>1.
Live Update Cycle (app.js)<o:p></o:p></span></h3>

<p><span style='font-family:"Calibri",sans-serif;color:#333333'>The Application
initializes a centralized </span><span class=SpellE><span class=GramE><span
class=code1><span style='font-size:10.0pt;color:#333333'>fetchData</span></span></span></span><span
class=GramE><span class=code1><span style='font-size:10.0pt;color:#333333'>(</span></span></span><span
class=code1><span style='font-size:10.0pt;color:#333333'>)</span></span><span
style='font-family:"Calibri",sans-serif;color:#333333'> payload validation
block to guarantee GUI components sync gracefully without overwriting
animations midway.<o:p></o:p></span></p>

<pre><span style='color:#333333'><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></pre><pre><span
style='color:#333333'>async <span class=SpellE><span class=GramE>fetchData</span></span><span
class=GramE>(</span>) {<o:p></o:p></span></pre><pre><span style='color:#333333'><span style='mso-spacerun:yes'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>try {<o:p></o:p></span></pre><pre><span
style='color:#333333'><span style='mso-spacerun:yes'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span
class=SpellE>const</span> response = await fetch('/<span class=SpellE>api</span>/data');<o:p></o:p></span></pre><pre><span
style='color:#333333'><span style='mso-spacerun:yes'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span
class=SpellE>const</span> data = await <span class=SpellE><span class=GramE>response.json</span></span>();<o:p></o:p></span></pre><pre><span
style='color:#333333'><span style='mso-spacerun:yes'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>// Fallback for dead connection intercept<o:p></o:p></span></pre><pre><span
style='color:#333333'><span style='mso-spacerun:yes'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>if (<span
class=SpellE><span class=GramE>data.connected</span></span> === false) {<o:p></o:p></span></pre><pre><span
style='color:#333333'><span style='mso-spacerun:yes'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span
class=SpellE><span class=GramE>this.handleDisconnectCallback</span></span>();<o:p></o:p></span></pre><pre><span
style='color:#333333'><span style='mso-spacerun:yes'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>return;<o:p></o:p></span></pre><pre><span
style='color:#333333'><span style='mso-spacerun:yes'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>}<o:p></o:p></span></pre><pre><span
style='color:#333333'><span style='mso-spacerun:yes'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span
class=SpellE><span class=GramE>this.updateUI</span></span>(data); // Propagate text &amp; <span
class=SpellE>svg</span> nodes<o:p></o:p></span></pre><pre><span
style='color:#333333'><span style='mso-spacerun:yes'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>} catch (e) {<o:p></o:p></span></pre><pre><span
style='color:#333333'><span style='mso-spacerun:yes'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>// Exception catching<o:p></o:p></span></pre><pre><span
style='color:#333333'><span style='mso-spacerun:yes'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>}<o:p></o:p></span></pre><pre><span
style='color:#333333'>}<o:p></o:p></span></pre>

<h3><span style='font-family:"Calibri",sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:"Times New Roman"'>2.
Dynamic Power Flow Calculations<o:p></o:p></span></h3>

<p><span style='font-family:"Calibri",sans-serif;color:#333333'>The application
algorithmically determines electron routing via comparative conditional logic
over live integer values:<o:p></o:p></span></p>

<ul type=disc>
 <li class=MsoNormal style='color:#333333;mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:
     auto;mso-list:l3 level1 lfo3;tab-stops:list 36.0pt'><b><span
     style='font-family:"Calibri",sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:"Times New Roman"'>Battery
     Vectoring:</span></b><span style='font-family:"Calibri",sans-serif;
     mso-fareast-font-family:"Times New Roman"'> If </span><span class=SpellE><span
     class=code1><span style='font-size:10.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:"Times New Roman"'>chargingCurrent</span></span></span><span
     class=code1><span style='font-size:10.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:"Times New Roman"'>
     &gt; 0</span></span><span style='font-family:"Calibri",sans-serif;
     mso-fareast-font-family:"Times New Roman"'>, mathematically toggles
     charging path tracking TRUE. If </span><span class=SpellE><span
     class=code1><span style='font-size:10.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:"Times New Roman"'>dischargingCurrent</span></span></span><span
     class=code1><span style='font-size:10.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:"Times New Roman"'>
     &gt; 0</span></span><span style='font-family:"Calibri",sans-serif;
     mso-fareast-font-family:"Times New Roman"'>, toggles discharging path
     TRUE.<o:p></o:p></span></li>
 <li class=MsoNormal style='color:#333333;mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:
     auto;mso-list:l3 level1 lfo3;tab-stops:list 36.0pt'><b><span
     style='font-family:"Calibri",sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:"Times New Roman"'>Consumer
     Evaluator:</span></b><span style='font-family:"Calibri",sans-serif;
     mso-fareast-font-family:"Times New Roman"'> Uses </span><span
     class=SpellE><span class=GramE><span class=code1><span style='font-size:
     10.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:"Times New Roman"'>Math.max</span></span></span></span><span
     class=GramE><span class=code1><span style='font-size:10.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:
     "Times New Roman"'>(</span></span></span><span class=code1><span
     style='font-size:10.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:"Times New Roman"'>0, <span
     class=SpellE>rectCur</span> + <span class=SpellE>mpptCur</span> + <span
     class=SpellE>poeCur</span> + (<span class=SpellE><span class=GramE>isCharging</span></span><span
     class=GramE> ?</span> -<span class=SpellE><span class=GramE>battCur</span></span><span
     class=GramE> :</span> <span class=SpellE>battCur</span>))</span></span><span
     style='font-family:"Calibri",sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:"Times New Roman"'>
     to dynamically formulate and synthesize the Load consumption metric
     without requiring an active sensor query.<o:p></o:p></span></li>
</ul>

<h2><span style='font-family:"Calibri",sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:"Times New Roman"'>5.
UI Styling and Graphical Specifics<o:p></o:p></span></h2>

<h3><span style='font-family:"Calibri",sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:"Times New Roman"'>SVG
Animation Bug Mitigations<o:p></o:p></span></h3>

<p><span style='font-family:"Calibri",sans-serif;color:#333333'>Because native
CSS <span class=SpellE>webkit</span> engines suffer from clipping coordinate
boundaries on pure </span><span class=code1><span style='font-size:10.0pt;
color:#333333'>0-height</span></span><span style='font-family:"Calibri",sans-serif;
color:#333333'> flat lines when applying gaussian blur, the physical topology
flow lines utilize algorithmic offset compensation:<o:p></o:p></span></p>

<ul type=disc>
 <li class=MsoNormal style='color:#333333;mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:
     auto;mso-list:l1 level1 lfo4;tab-stops:list 36.0pt'><span class=SpellE><b><span
     style='font-family:"Calibri",sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:"Times New Roman"'>UserSpaceOnUse</span></b></span><b><span
     style='font-family:"Calibri",sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:"Times New Roman"'>:</span></b><span
     style='font-family:"Calibri",sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:"Times New Roman"'>
     SVG Filter bounding logic is detached from the target shape (straight
     line) and bonded to the global parent canvas using the property </span><span
     class=SpellE><span class=code1><span style='font-size:10.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:
     "Times New Roman"'>filterUnits</span></span></span><span class=code1><span
     style='font-size:10.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:"Times New Roman"'>=&quot;<span
     class=SpellE>userSpaceOnUse</span>&quot;</span></span><span
     style='font-family:"Calibri",sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:"Times New Roman"'>.<o:p></o:p></span></li>
 <li class=MsoNormal style='color:#333333;mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:
     auto;mso-list:l1 level1 lfo4;tab-stops:list 36.0pt'><b><span
     style='font-family:"Calibri",sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:"Times New Roman"'>Subpixel
     Offsets:</span></b><span style='font-family:"Calibri",sans-serif;
     mso-fareast-font-family:"Times New Roman"'> Instead of pure horizontal
     axes (</span><span class=code1><span style='font-size:10.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:
     "Times New Roman"'>y2 = y1</span></span><span style='font-family:"Calibri",sans-serif;
     mso-fareast-font-family:"Times New Roman"'>), coordinates utilize
     invisible <span class=GramE>0.01 pixel</span> adjustments (</span><span
     class=code1><span style='font-size:10.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:"Times New Roman"'>L
     370 205.01</span></span><span style='font-family:"Calibri",sans-serif;
     mso-fareast-font-family:"Times New Roman"'>) establishing valid
     mathematical bounding dimensions for the Chromium GPU acceleration engine.<o:p></o:p></span></li>
</ul>

<h3><span style='font-family:"Calibri",sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:"Times New Roman"'>Glass-morphism
Architecture<o:p></o:p></span></h3>

<p><span style='font-family:"Calibri",sans-serif;color:#333333'>The visual
schema relies completely on CSS backdrop composites </span><span class=code1><span
style='font-size:10.0pt;color:#333333'>backdrop-filter: blur(20px);</span></span><span
style='font-family:"Calibri",sans-serif;color:#333333'> coupled with
semi-transparent alphas </span><span class=SpellE><span class=GramE><span
class=code1><span style='font-size:10.0pt;color:#333333'>rgba</span></span></span></span><span
class=GramE><span class=code1><span style='font-size:10.0pt;color:#333333'>(</span></span></span><span
class=code1><span style='font-size:10.0pt;color:#333333'>0, 0, 0, 0.2)</span></span><span
style='font-family:"Calibri",sans-serif;color:#333333'> against a pure CSS
dark-theme coordinate space to create highly translucent data containers.<o:p></o:p></span></p>

<h3><span style='font-family:"Calibri",sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:"Times New Roman"'>Responsive
Auto-Clamp Layouts<o:p></o:p></span></h3>

<p><span style='font-family:"Calibri",sans-serif;color:#333333'>The dashboard
grid utilizes </span><span class=code1><span style='font-size:10.0pt;
color:#333333'>grid-template-columns: <span class=GramE>repeat(</span>auto-fit,
<span class=GramE>minmax(</span>600px, 1fr));</span></span><span
style='font-family:"Calibri",sans-serif;color:#333333'> alongside </span><span
class=code1><span style='font-size:10.0pt;color:#333333'>flex-grow</span></span><span
style='font-family:"Calibri",sans-serif;color:#333333'> algorithms to allow
elements (like the System Power Flow array and Telemetry Stacks) to snap
together dynamically regardless of display aspect ratio dependencies.<o:p></o:p></span></p>

</div>

